      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Maybe I've misunderstood, because the related feature requests were also not closed with Complete status.\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/allow-viewing-events-from-notifications\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/link-to-the-event-in-event-notifications\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-jump-to-event-in-group-calendar-event\n\nThe changelog says:\n\n> Fixed a bug that prevented links from showing up on notifications.\n\nI found this statement difficult to understand for the intent it attempted to convey, without a sublist item explaining what was missing.",
